      <div class="content-area">
        <h2>Our Academics</h2>
        <p class="academic-intro">
          At <b>J.B. Matric Hr. Sec. School</b>, we focus on a balanced and comprehensive education
          that nurtures intellectual curiosity, critical thinking, and creativity.
          Our academic programs are designed to help each child reach their fullest potential.
        </p>

        <div class="academic-cards">
          <div class="academic-card">
            <h3>Primary (Grades I to V)</h3>
            <p>
              We focus on building strong foundations in language, mathematics,
              and environmental science. Activities are designed to make learning
              fun and interactive through storytelling, projects, and visual aids.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="academic-card">
            <h3>Middle School (Grades VI to VIII)</h3>
            <p>
              Students explore core subjects like Science, Social Studies, and Computer Education.
              We encourage independent learning and group projects that build teamwork and creativity.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="academic-card">
            <h3>High School (Grades IX to XII)</h3>
            <p>
              Senior students receive focused academic guidance to excel in board exams.
              We offer Science and Commerce streams with well-equipped labs, smart classes,
              and career-oriented mentoring sessions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
